5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I'm looking forward to working with you all to choose the best program. I think it's important we consider the long-term sustainability of whatever we decide on today.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree, Midori. Sustainability is key. I believe it would also be prudent to understand the actual outcomes of our previous efforts before we commit to a new direction.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We should base our decision on objective data rather than assumptions. It will be helpful to see how current resources are being utilized before we commit to a new program.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Sustainability is a fine word, but let's be precise. I want to see the actual numbers behind the budget and the potential for returns. Logic, not optimism, should guide this selection.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I agree that data is important, but let us also remember the people who will make these programs work every day. I hope we can find a gentle balance.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Shizue. To ensure we don't overstretch our staff, I'd like to look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the board minutes on a jointly run clinic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be helpful to review the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round to see what our previous initiatives actually achieved.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I want to understand the current pressure on our clinical teams.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll take the development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. If we're talking about sustainability, we should start with the actual money available and how it's generated.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think it would be wise to see how our physical space is holding up. I will look into the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and also what the booking system records.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,It seems we have a good spread of information being gathered. I'm curious if anyone else feels we should look into the data agreements with outside surgeries to see how our external partnerships are currently structured?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a valid point, Midori. Understanding our external dependencies could certainly provide a more complete picture of our operational capacity. Perhaps someone else has the capacity to look into that.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I have already selected my two items. Since we are all limited in what we can investigate, perhaps someone else who hasn't focused on staffing or budget can take that on.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, you're suggesting we add more to the list, but we've already committed to our choices. Let's stick to the plan and see what the data actually tells us first. Efficiency is key.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, it is a lovely thought to consider our partners, but perhaps we should follow Shion's advice for now. Let us see what we find first and then we can decide if we need more.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,"You're right, Shion. I apologize for getting ahead of myself. I'll stick to my original choices and look forward to hearing what everyone discovers. Let's see where the data leads us.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us proceed with a quiet mind and see what the records reveal. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's move forward and review the findings. I'll be interested to see how the staffing data aligns with the other operational metrics.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,Indeed. Let's hope the findings are substantial enough to avoid any vague generalizations. I'll be waiting to see if the numbers actually support the optimism some of you are displaying.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, Shion, let's keep our hearts open. I am sure we will all find something useful in the records. I look forward to seeing what we discover together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
